---
layout: base.njk
title: Feedback and bug reports
description: Tell us what you think of Deaftly, or report something that isn't working.
---
<div class="wrap section section--tight prose">
<h1>Feedback and bug reports</h1>
<p class="lede">Tell us what's working, what isn't, or what you'd like Deaftly to do.</p>
<p>Please don't include health details or other personal details in your message. See <a href="/privacy/">privacy</a> for what we keep and for how long.</p>

<noscript><p>This form needs JavaScript for its check that you're not a bot. If you'd rather not turn it on, email hello@deaftly.com instead.</p></noscript>

<form class="feedback-form" action="{{ engage.submissions }}" method="post">
<input type="hidden" name="product" value="deaftly">
<input type="hidden" name="source" value="web">

<fieldset>
<legend>What's this about?</legend>
<label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="kind" value="feedback" checked> Feedback or an idea</label>
<label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="kind" value="issue"> Something's not working</label>
</fieldset>

<label for="message">Your message</label>
<textarea id="message" name="message" rows="8" maxlength="5000" required aria-describedby="message-hint"></textarea>
<p id="message-hint" class="muted">Up to 5,000 characters. If something's not working, say what you did and what happened.</p>

<label for="appVersion">App version (optional)</label>
<input id="appVersion" name="appVersion" type="text" inputmode="decimal" pattern="\d+\.\d+\.\d+" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="version-hint">
<p id="version-hint" class="muted">Three numbers, like 0.49.2. It's in your phone's Settings, under Apps, then Deaftly.</p>

<label for="contactEmail">Your email address (optional)</label>
<input id="contactEmail" name="contactEmail" type="email" maxlength="254" autocomplete="email" aria-describedby="email-hint">
<p id="email-hint" class="muted">Only if you'd like a reply. Without it, we can't answer you.</p>

<fieldset class="quote-fields" aria-describedby="quote-hint">
<legend>Can we quote you? (optional)</legend>
<p id="quote-hint" class="muted">We might share what you said on this site. We never show your email address.</p>
<label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="quoteConsent" value="true"> Yes, you can quote what I said</label>
<label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="credit" value="anonymous" checked> Don't show my name</label>
<label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="credit" value="initials"> Show my initials</label>
<label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="credit" value="name"> Show my name</label>
<label for="contactName">Your name (optional)</label>
<input id="contactName" name="contactName" type="text" maxlength="100" autocomplete="name">
</fieldset>

<div class="trap" aria-hidden="true">
<label for="hpx">Leave this empty</label>
<input id="hpx" name="hpx" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
</div>

<div class="cf-turnstile" data-sitekey="{{ engage.turnstileSiteKey }}"></div>

<button class="button" type="submit">Send</button>
</form>
<script src="https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js" async defer></script>
</div>
